  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan Water Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will fortify the countrys water supply and meet the growing demand. The firms team of water infrastructure experts is upgrading Jordans water system using a multidisciplinary approach to ensure Jordans water security and long-term access to water and sanitation services. CDM Smith is supporting by assessing Jordans current water system, developing water and wastewater models, utilizing Geographic Information System (GIS) and other advanced modeling software, studying alternatives and recommending system improvements through a phased planning approach. Project work consists of a multiple-site, multiple-project infrastructure investment program divided into nine tasks to deliver specific improvements throughout Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
